WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.256
Torrents of bitter rain lash against the towering stone peaks of Mount Myoboku.

2
00:00:05.256 --> 00:00:11.352
Young ninja Naruto Uzumaki sits motionless atop a massive, weathered toad statue.

3
00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:16.968
Wild natural energy swirls invisibly through the thick, damp mountain atmosphere.

4
00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:22.823
Deep orange pigmentation suddenly erupts around his fierce, determined blue eyes.

5
00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:28.343
A violent surge of primal chakra threatens to consume his human soul entirely.

6
00:00:28.343 --> 00:00:33.815
Wise master Fukasaku watches closely from a nearby mossy stone outcrop.

7
00:00:33.815 --> 00:00:39.287
Absolute stillness must conquer the chaotic storm raging deep within his spirit.

8
00:00:39.287 --> 00:00:44.879
The tumultuous downpour parts as powerful sacred energy finally aligns within him.

9
00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:50.855
Brilliant horizontal yellow iris markings reveal the ultimate mastery of sage jutsu.

10
00:00:50.855 --> 00:00:55.847
He stands triumphant as the true legendary successor of Mount Myoboku.
